  "title": {
   "en": "Fuguu Reijou to Hikikomori Mahoutsukai Futari de Slow Life wo Mezashimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "不遇令嬢とひきこもり魔法使い ふたりでスローライフを目指します"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "My place is next to you, standing in the sunshine. Nevilletta was born into a distinguished family of wizards, but she has no talent for magic. She has lived her life hiding her existence from the world, but a turning point comes for her. The prince orders her to recall Eldo, a wizard who was instrumental in the recent victory, from the frontier. Nicknamed the \"Soul Eater,\" Eldo is the subject of endless rumors of his cruelty. Nevilletta, who is prepared to give her life, meets a noble and beautiful young man. During her rendezvous with him, Nevilletta experiences love for the first time. A Cinderella fantasy about an abandoned young lady's dramatic reversal."
  },
